  "title": "Someone Open-Sourced an Entire Army of AI Hackers That Break Into Your App for You",
  "description": "Strix is an open-source AI security platform that helps you find vulnerabilities before attackers do.\n\nInstead of only scanning your code, it uses AI agents to analyze your application, identify potential security issues, validate them, and even suggest fixes you can merge into your project.\n\nFrom SQL injection and broken access control to other common security flaws, Strix is designed to automate a large part of the security review process.\n\nIf you're building apps with AI, this is one of the most useful open-source security tools to have in your workflow.\n\n#opensource #cybersecurity #ai #developer #github #appsec",
